{title: All Creatures of Our God and King}
{key: C}
{time: 3/4}
{columns: 2}

{start_of_verse: 1}
All [C]creatures of our [Am]God & [G]King
Lift [C]up your voice & [Am]with us [G]sing
O [F]Praise [C]ye! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia!
O [C]brother [G]sun with [Am]golden [G]beam
O [C]sister [Em]moon with [Am]silver [G]gleam
O [G]praise [C]Ye, [Dm]O [G]praise [Am]ye!
Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [F]Alle[G]lu-[C]ia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
O [C]brother wind, air, [Am]clouds, & [G]rain
By [C]which all creatures [Am]ye sus[G]tain
O [F]Praise [C]ye! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia!
Thou [C]rising [G]morn in [Am]praise re[G]joice
Ye [C]lights of [Em]evening [Am]find a [G]voice
O [G]praise [C]Ye, [Dm]O [G]praise [Am]ye!
Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [F]Alle[G]lu-[C]ia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
O [C]sister water, [Am]flowing [G]clear
Make [C]music for thy [Am]Lord to [G]hear
Alle[F]lu[C]ia! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia!
O [C]brother [G]fire who [Am]lights the [G]night
Pro[C]viding [Em]warmth, en[Am]hancing [G]sight
O [G]praise [C]Ye, [Dm]O [G]praise [Am]ye!
Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [F]Alle[G]lu-[C]ia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
Dear [C]mother earth, who [Am]day by [G]day
Un[C]foldest blessings [Am]on our [G]way
Alle[F]lu[C]ia! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia!
The [C]flow'rs & [G]fruits that [Am]in thee [G]grow
Let [C]them God's [Em]glory [Am]also [G]show!
O [G]praise [C]Ye, [Dm]O [G]praise [Am]ye!
Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [F]Alle[G]lu-[C]ia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 5}
All [C]ye who are of [Am]tender [G]heart
For[C]giving others, [Am]take your [G]part
O [F]praise [C]ye! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia!
Ye [C]who long [G]pain and [Am]sorrow [G]bear
Praise [C]God & [Em]on him [Am]cast your [G]care!
O [G]praise [C]Ye, [Dm]O [G]praise [Am]ye!
Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [F]Alle[G]lu-[C]ia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 6}
And [C]thou, our sister, [Am]gentle [G]death
Wai[C]ting to hush our [Am]latest [G]breath
Alle[F]lu[C]ia! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia!
Thou [C]leadest [G]home the [Am]child of [G]God
And [C]Christ our [Em]Lord the [Am]way has [G]trod
O [G]praise [C]Ye, [Dm]O [G]praise [Am]ye!
Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [F]Alle[G]lu-[C]ia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 7}
Let [C]all things their Cre[Am]ator [G]bless
And [C]worship him in [Am]humble[G]ness
O [F]praise [C]ye! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia!
Praise, [C]praise the [G]Father, [Am]praise the [G]Son
And [C]praise the [Em]Spirit, [Am]Three in [G]One!
O [G]praise [C]Ye, [Dm]O [G]praise [Am]ye!
Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [Am]Alle[D]lu[G]ia! [F]Alle[G]lu-[C]ia!
{end_of_verse}
